## Named options support using `IConfigureNamedOptions`

Named options:

* Are useful when multiple configuration sections bind to the same properties.
* Are case sensitive.

Consider the following JSON configuration:

```json
"TopItem": {
  "Month": {
    "Name": "Green Widget",
