The **Endpoint** middleware in the preceding diagram executes the filter pipeline for the corresponding app type—MVC or Razor Pages.

The preceding diagram shows the **Routing** middleware following **Static Files**. This order is how the project templates work by explicitly calling app.UseRouting. If you don't call `app.UseRouting`, the **Routing** middleware runs at the beginning of the pipeline by default. For more information, see Routing.

