Parameter binding for Minimal APIs binds parameters through dependency injection when the type is configured as a service. It's not necessary to explicitly apply the [`[FromServices]`](xref:Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.FromServicesAttribute) attribute to a parameter. In the following code, both actions return the time:

