|<xref:Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ControllerBase.PhysicalFile*>|Returns a file.|
|<xref:Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.ControllerBase.TryUpdateModelAsync*>|Invokes model binding.|
